GGAUUCUUGUUACAUGUUCGC&UGACCCACCUCCUGGAAUGACCUUAAAUGAGAAGAGUGUUCAAAAUUCAAUUACACAGUGGAUUGUAGACAUGGAAGGUGCACCAGGUACCUUAUAUGAAGGGGAAAAAUUUCAACUUCUAUUUAAAUUUAGUAGUCGAUAUCCUUUUGACUCUCCUCAGGUCAUGUUUACUGGUGAAAAUAUUCCUGUUCAUCCUCAUGUUUAUAGCAAUGGUCAUAUCUGUUUAUCCAUUC\
